  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.5.0:\n\t\t\t- Removed size limitation on encryption which was in package 2.4.0\n\t\t\t- Added RSA-encrypted JWT decryption and encoding - decoding support using AES.\n\t\t\t- Extract raw JWT and claims using a simple API.\n\t\t\t- No breaking changes to existing FIX or utility features.",
